    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=1\\pm\\sqrt2$.",
      "worked": "$x\\ne\\pm1$. Multiply by $(x-1)(x+1)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}(x+2)(x+1)-x(x-1)&=2(x-1)(x+1)\\\\4x+2&=2x^2-2\\\\x^2-2x-1&=0\\\\(x-1)^2&=2\\\\x-1&=\\pm\\sqrt2\\\\x&=1\\pm\\sqrt2.\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are admissible.",
